OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'armed with weapons' arrested
OL,4,Aafter assaulting police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 43-year-old has been arrested after
OL,7,Freports of a man "armed with weapons"
OL,8,Fand "behaving in a disorderly manner".
OL,10,FPolice received reports of an armed man
OL,11,Fattempting to damage vehicles in the
OL,12,FUpper Water Street area of Newry,
OL,13,FCounty Down, at about 20:20 GMT on
OL,14,FFriday.
OL,16,FThe weapons were discarded before
OL,17,Fpolice arrived and have since been
OL,18,Frecovered for examination.
OL,20,FTwo police officers were also assaulted
OL,21,Fby the man, with one sustaining minor
OL,22,Finjury, however both remained on duty.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
